 "scope": "Component-list JSON from reference convert: every emitted component key except random GUIDs. Keys absent from Rust output are compared as the empty value of the C# type; Rust-only keys (NameFieldContent, UnresolvedMasters) are not compared. Parity covers this corpus only. Preamble, epilogue, widescreen-warning metadata, drafted instructions and installs are not covered. Guides without ### sections: reference returns [] (exit 0); Rust exits 1 (open difference).",
